#: f4f56ee3dd7f4570a4f74324595596cc
msgid ""
"The `FrSky Taranis RC Transmitter <https://www.frsky-rc.com/product/taranis-"
"q-x7-2/>`__ is a high quality `OpenTX <http://www.open-"
"tx.org/downloads.html>`__ (open source firmware) enabled RC Transmitter that"
" is compatible with a wide variety of high quality FrSky PPM-Sum and S.Bus "
"compatible receivers."
msgstr ""
"`FrSky Taranis 遥控器 <https://www.frsky-rc.com/product/taranis-q-x7-2/>`__ "
"是一款高质量的 `OpenTX <http://www.open-tx.org/downloads.html>`__ （开源固件）遥控器，与多种高质量 "
"FrSky PPM-Sum 和 S.Bus 兼容接收机相配套。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-rc.rst:42 312949edd351448eb9f4e5f551fa330d
#: 3525f60b0b1745d48706272a8bbcc669 560c78c4ed0a4f60a7089065b44f1ce8
#: 6c12c619e70649a1b7693d77f131e033 dae1afd2534349d09d6539c3e65913bb
#: f82f220423ca49ceb7aa644d741dedc8
msgid ""
"One of the major advantages of the Taranis is that it can receive and "
"display telemetry data **directly from ArduPilot** and on-board FrSky "
"telemetry sensors, such as flight mode, GPS status, current drawn and cell "
"voltages, and even ArduPilot messages, that can be added to your vehicle. "
"For more information, see :ref:`FrSky telemetry <common-frsky-telemetry>`."
msgstr ""
"Taranis 的主要优势之一是它可以直接从 ArduPilot 以及机载 FrSky 数传传感器接收并显示数传数据，包括飞行模式、GPS "
"状态、电流消耗、电芯电压，甚至可以添加到飞行器上的 ArduPilot 消息。更多信息请参见 :ref:`FrSky 数传 <common-frsky-"
"telemetry>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-rc.rst:44 2ac74c21f58846bbb89d741d88e8887f
#: ae70430f497d4b3195fc2ac1651d2083 c785676ff54144ab989ebde363e76664
#: d6efa5559d3f413380346cbc346b6109 df30bf195f7049c8a2358268a4a1ff98
#: ef159cc13eac4250a2ec84f8f17b519e
msgid ""
"The Taranis transmitters have integrated ACCST 2.4GHz transmitters that are "
"compatible with X series FrSky receivers such as the very popular X8R or the"
" newer and lighter XSR receivers. *This means that an additional JR type "
"transmitter module is not required.* If needed, both the Taranis X9D Plus "
"and the Taranis QX7 have JR module bays for external radio transmitters."
msgstr ""
"Taranis 遥控器集成了 ACCST 2.4GHz 发射机，与 X 系列 FrSky 接收机兼容，例如非常流行的 X8R 或更新、更轻的 XSR "
"接收机。*这意味着不需要额外的 JR 型发射机模块。* 如有需要，Taranis X9D Plus 和 Taranis QX7 "
"均配有用于外置无线电发射机的 JR 模块槽。"

