msgid ""
"FrSky has many compatible receivers. Some ouput PPM, some SBus. Almost all "
"offer telemetry in some form. Any receiver with S.Port offers bi-directional"
" telemetry. For more information about FrSky receiver telemetry, refer to "
"the :ref:`FrSky telemetry page <common-frsky-telemetry>`."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 有许多兼容接收机。部分输出 PPM，部分输出 SBus。几乎所有接收机都以某种形式提供数传。具有 S.Port 的接收机均支持双向数传。有关"
" FrSky 接收机数传的更多信息，请参见 :ref:`FrSky 数传页面 <common-frsky-telemetry>`。"

